{"title":"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cddbccf89c00e019e9878f87f8d6325697e3f2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> of radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/1/b81097ac54e434963766001e47caa1dcd88003fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> is internally tangent to a larger circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7cef5fa7ec053472a6e471aaacb0c5927ce36b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> of radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/f/34f7a9875557179ece650016df1cc310df671c71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> such that the center of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7cef5fa7ec053472a6e471aaacb0c5927ce36b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cddbccf89c00e019e9878f87f8d6325697e3f2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" />. A diameter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7cef5fa7ec053472a6e471aaacb0c5927ce36b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> is drawn tangent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cddbccf89c00e019e9878f87f8d6325697e3f2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" />. A second line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b25f8e64b484493fda944d25cad453423041fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l$\" width=\"5\" height=\"12\" /> is drawn from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> tangent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cddbccf89c00e019e9878f87f8d6325697e3f2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" />. Let the line tangent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7cef5fa7ec053472a6e471aaacb0c5927ce36b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> intersect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b25f8e64b484493fda944d25cad453423041fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l$\" width=\"5\" height=\"12\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Find the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/1/b81097ac54e434963766001e47caa1dcd88003fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cddbccf89c00e019e9878f87f8d6325697e3f2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> has the radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7cef5fa7ec053472a6e471aaacb0c5927ce36b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> has the radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec701493fa72dda5d6747fe14f30e7b1c2fb6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />.\nThe base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />.\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> be the centre of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cddbccf89c00e019e9878f87f8d6325697e3f2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be the centre of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7cef5fa7ec053472a6e471aaacb0c5927ce36b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" />.\nIn <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/1/1112e5a5a063553a1cf7d1ce676171e4b06b567e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle MBN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/3/b032f78edb8aebc9bb7d41eba96760d0f30459dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan MBN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />.\nAlso <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3ad57710b6810476e6017ea2c2cc6d41219c218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> = 2 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/3/c83c637643dd6cfa20e52e5d08ba6f2877a4a043.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle MBN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"14\" />.\nusing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/8/46809f2ea559cc16a5f5d557ae890f61508de8fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c8518eac11259e7adbf28a69660051ea7a6dc14f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2{\\tan x}}{1 - {tan x}^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"82\" height=\"40\" /> we get,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/f/45f9489e1f2a177624953fea11b14f3a2bc9a9cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan \\angle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b33bd495b7492f95385da7afb197cd34638cdfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />\nfrom this <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b33bd495b7492f95385da7afb197cd34638cdfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />\nNow area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/3/cb3260fed79a2be492b2b1b93c69c2e77f93f66d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{16x}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"34\" height=\"38\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />\nPutting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/1/b81097ac54e434963766001e47caa1dcd88003fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" />, we get the area as 768.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006\">Mock AIME 5 2005-2006</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=76847\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018040447\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 313/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1441/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 199/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8424/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.308      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%    7.308      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13368:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018040447 and revision id 281669. Re